OL,3,GNEWSATory Andrew RT Davies accuses
OL,4,APlaid ministers of lying to Covid
OL,5,Abereaved families
OL,6,
OL,7,FSenior Conservative politician Andrew
OL,8,FRT Davies has accused Plaid Cymru
OL,9,Fministers of "lying" to campaigners for
OL,10,Ffamilies who lost relatives to
OL,11,FCovid-19.
OL,13,FDavies told the Senedd that Health
OL,14,FMinister Mabon ap Gwynfor had assured a
OL,15,Fgroup representing the families a
OL,16,Freview would have legal powers to
OL,17,Fcompel people to give evidence only to
OL,18,F"renege" on this.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
