OL,3,GNEWSATory Andrew RT Davies accuses
OL,4,APlaid ministers of lying to Covid
OL,5,Abereaved families
OL,6,
OL,7,FResponding to a Tory-led debate calling
OL,8,Ffor a "statutory judge-led public
OL,9,Finquiry", a minister said Plaid's
OL,10,FSenedd election manifesto was "clear"
OL,11,Fthat the review would lack statutory
OL,12,Fpowers.
OL,14,FAsked to "reflect" on his remarks about
OL,15,Fap Gwynfor and another minister
OL,16,F"lying", Davies declined adding "I
OL,17,Fbelieve they have".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
